  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have been monitoring this for 2 months now and noticing that the added chair stations on avatars , causes 30-80% of fps drop whenever avatars use them in world (the less optimized one of the avatars is the worse the fps drop get (putting a medium ranked avatar for instance in a good ranked avatar chair station is the same as a Very Poor avatar that is shooting 100 000 particles everywhere and has 45 colliders on him / her)\n\nMy suggestion ... using a chair on an avatar disables any and all components not default to Vrchat) or have the chairs removed completely",
